Gemini smoke check
Date: 2026-04-01
Server: http://localhost:3001

Exact flat curl body response:
{"ok":false,"error":"Invalid image: Only JPG and PNG images are allowed."}

Root cause analysis:
- The flat request shape goes through normalizeMentorRequest() in server/index.cjs.
- That function always adds imageBase64, imageMimeType, and imageName keys to the derived payload, even when the caller did not send any image fields.
- validateMentorImagePayload() in server/mentorImageSupport.cjs checks hasOwn(payload, "imageBase64" | "imageMimeType" | "imageName"), so the flat learn_teach request is treated as an image request.
- Because imageMimeType is empty, the validator returns: "Only JPG and PNG images are allowed."
- Result: the exact flat curl body cannot reach Gemini at all; it is rejected earlier by the mentor image validation path.

